[E-PARSE] Error: a whole namespace can't be imported under another name
   ╭─[ reject/import-as.sw:4:17 ]
   │
 4 │ import Std.List as L
   │                 ─┬  
   │                  ╰── `import … as …` isn't supported
   │ 
   │ Note 1: to write `List.x` for `Std.List.x`, import the namespace by its own last name: `import Std (List)`
